    ["措施与对策", "fund rehabilitation programmes", "资助帮助重新融入社会的项目", "Governments can fund rehabilitation programmes that let participants finish a training qualification they began in prison.", "政府可以资助帮助重返社会的项目，让参与者完成服刑期间开始学习的职业资格课程。"],
    ["措施与对策", "provide support for witnesses", "为证人提供支持", "Courts could provide support for witnesses by explaining the timetable in advance and arranging a quiet place to wait.", "法院可以提前说明日程并安排安静的等候场所，从而为证人提供支持。"],
    ["措施与对策", "maintain contact after release", "在获释后保持联系", "Community advisers can maintain contact after release so that a missed housing appointment does not leave someone without further guidance.", "社区顾问可以在当事人获释后保持联系，使其不会因为错过一次住房咨询就失去后续指导。"]
